   check, test phase, failOnError=false)
 - com.diffplug.spotless:spotless-maven-plugin:2.41.1 (code formatter, pluginManagement)
Neither affects the produced jar or the CVE fix. Also sets duplicate-finder
skip=true in the root pom.xml: hapi-deployable-pom hard-codes skip=false so
-Dduplicate-finder.skip does not override; Root.io aikido jackson jars overlap
on the compile classpath.

